    noticed some commotion in the village with Bebhinn.\",\"parentUIDs\":[19],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Bl\xE1ith\xEDn\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-1.64285278,\"yPos\":469.714172},\"ID\":23,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    should head straight over and investigate!\",\"parentUIDs\":[22],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Bl\xE1ith\xEDn\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":25}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":529.642761,\"yPos\":393.714172},\"ID\":24,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    haven't destroyed the forest.\",\"parentUIDs\":[20],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Bl\xE1ith\xEDn\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":541.642761,\"yPos\":546.714},\"ID\":25,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But
